Z||000021||NOS3800||09-10-2001||11:54 PM||||DAMN, I was hoping to be  the first NOS V6 to be in the 12's!!!! GOOD JOB! What kinda HP do you think you are using? I have only managied a 13.4 with a 75 shot and 3800 motor. Thinking of stepping up to 100 HP. I got a purge valve now so hopefully that will help my 60 fts, but I will definitely will not make the 12's till I increase the jets. Mine is an auto also. Now I feel slow since your 2.8 is in the twelves. wow. I heard you shouldn't let the bottle sink below 5lbs. cause the performance decreases drastically. I have noticed this, especially when making immediate back to back runs. Seems the pressure just drops! Need a bottle warmer I guess. If you decraese your rim size in the rear you sould be even quicker!<P>------------------<BR>Purple 1988 GT<BR>NOS injected 3800 Series II V6<BR>Best ET(75 shot)-13.45@101.12 mph<BR>w/o NOS 14.86@92.06mph<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BillCar2001_4.jpg"> ||||reg||11
