Z||000035||1FST2M6||09-17-2001||09:32 AM||||befroe 7pm the 1/8th is open for free.. afer 7 the 1/4 opens for $15. i gave my slips to a friend with a better scanner... the lite blue on white wouldn't register really on my POS scanner. if anyone is wanting a nitrous kit WET is the ONLY way to go. I'm gunna pull a compression and leak down test on my car this week to see if it's changed at all since i've uped the jetting. <P>31/18 38hp, 35/20 53hp, 41/24 74hp, 52/33(LEAN) 137hp, 52/35 124.7hp, 62/41 163hp thats what our dyno shows on my car.. with a constant 900(ish)psi bottle pressure. <P>the only thing that i've noticed on my car was the wheel bearing and 3 wheels studs. i replaced both rear wheel bearing hub assemblies and it's fine now. i installed a rear deck scoop this weekend (sat 1am) from an 01 Mustang. I got it as payment for installing a wet system and other stuff on a friends Saleen Focus.  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstscoop.jpg">  <P>i should have a readable 1/4 this afternoon<p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 09-17-2001).]||||reg||1
